[A.]
<h2>Destroy the Unity</h2>
<i>~I~l"In the darkest of times the three priests of unity will return again to lift Nimbus from its shame"<br>
~N--The Book of Nimbus~.</i>
<p>It becomes increasingly obvious that your victory is inevitable, you are on your way to Storm Pass, the most vital stategic point in all of Nimbus,- if you control it then you control most of  Nimbus. A Dazzling light blinds you for a moment. When it is gone, Three islands block your path. It is the legendary unity of Nimbus. If you can destroy them then surely the time of balance between the furies is over. Taking a deep breath you chant for the construction of a temple.... 

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

