[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]

<h2>Victory!</h2>
<p><br>As you complete the sacrifice, the final priest of unity pleads with you ~I"Destroying the other two furies will not solve anything"~. he screams ~I"The only way to achieve peace is for all three to work in harmony"</br>
<br>~.~I~l"That can never be"~N you say ~I"I canot rest until Nimbus is ruled by the one true fury." "I cannot rest until <?{vn_windall}> Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}> Rain</?> has achieved total ~BDomination"
</br>
