[ai1TempleDead]
<h2>Your Temple is destroyed</h2>
<p>With the source of your power gone the Unity watse no time in sacrificing you. Pain screams through your being as the sacrificial knife bites deep into your felsh. The pain reaches an intensity that can only be experienced by those who would die, and so you do. 
